title: Panzerkreuzer A
subtitle: A political question
tags: event, govt_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_seen = 1
face-image: img/panzerkreuzer.jpg
view-if: panzerkreuzer_seen = 0 and year = 1928 and month >= 8 and reichswehr_minister_party != "SPD" and spd_in_government = 1
new-page: true

= Panzerkreuzer

The Reichswehr Ministry is demanding the construction of a new battlecruiser, as part of Germany's rearmament. Our coalition partners are united in support. While many of our members are vehemently against new military spending, this vote may be necessary to preserve the coalition.
We campaigned on food for children instead of battlecruisers. Will we really betray our campaign promises?

- @vote_yes: Vote yes, for constructing the battlecruiser.
- @vote_no: Vote no, against constructing the battlecruiser.
- @abstain: Abstain from the vote.

@vote_yes
on-arrival: left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 6; workers_spd -= 3; spd_pk_vote = "yes"
go-to: calc_panzerkreuzer

@vote_no
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 8; z_relation -= 5; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); spd_pk_vote = "no"
go-to: calc_panzerkreuzer

@abstain
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 5; z_relation -= 3; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; kpd_relation -= 3; spd_pk_vote = "abstain"
go-to: calc_panzerkreuzer

@calc_panzerkreuzer
on-arrival: {!
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes = 0;
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no = 0;
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain = 0;

Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes_parties = [];
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no_parties = [];
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain_parties = [];

for (var i = 0; i < Q.parties.length; i++) {
    var party = Q.parties[i];

    if (party === "spd") {
        Q[party + "_pk_vote"] = Q.spd_pk_vote;
    } else {
        var score = Q[party + "_ideo_score"];
        Q[party + "_pk_vote"] = (score !== undefined && score <= 9) ? "no" : "yes";
    }

    var seats = Q[party + "_r"] || 0;
    var label = Q.PARTY_DISPLAY_NAMES && Q.PARTY_DISPLAY_NAMES[party]
        ? Q.PARTY_DISPLAY_NAMES[party].replace(/^The /, "")
        : party.toUpperCase();

    if (Q[party + "_pk_vote"] === "yes") {
        Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes += seats;
        Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes_parties.push(label);
    } else if (Q[party + "_pk_vote"] === "no") {
        Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no += seats;
        Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no_parties.push(label);
    } else {
        Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain += seats;
        Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain_parties.push(label);
    }
}

Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes = Math.round(Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes * 10) / 10;
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no = Math.round(Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no * 10) / 10;
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain = Math.round(Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain * 10) / 10;

var voting_total = Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes + Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no;
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes_share = voting_total > 0 ? Math.round((Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes / voting_total) * 1000) / 10 : 0;
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no_share = voting_total > 0 ? Math.round((Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no / voting_total) * 1000) / 10 : 0;

Q.panzerkreuzer_a_result = (Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes > Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no) ? "pass" : "fail";
Q.panzerkreuzer_funded = (Q.panzerkreuzer_a_result === "pass") ? 1 : 0;
Q.panzerkreuzer_failed = (Q.panzerkreuzer_a_result === "fail") ? 1 : 0;

Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes_list = Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes_parties.length > 0 ? Q.panzerkreuzer_a_yes_parties.join(", ") : "none";
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no_list = Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no_parties.length > 0 ? Q.panzerkreuzer_a_no_parties.join(", ") : "none";
Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain_list = Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain_parties.length > 0 ? Q.panzerkreuzer_a_abstain_parties.join(", ") : "none";
!}
go-to: panzerkreuzer_pass if panzerkreuzer_a_result = "pass"; panzerkreuzer_fail if panzerkreuzer_a_result = "fail"

@panzerkreuzer_pass
on-arrival: nationalism += 3*(1-dissent); workers_spd -= 3*(1-dissent)

The votes are tallied in the Reichstag.

**For** ([+ panzerkreuzer_a_yes +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_a_yes_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_a_yes_list +]
**Against** ([+ panzerkreuzer_a_no +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_a_no_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_a_no_list +]
**Abstaining** ([+ panzerkreuzer_a_abstain +] seats): [+ panzerkreuzer_a_abstain_list +]

The measure passes. The ship will be built.

[? if spd_pk_vote = "yes": Having voted for it ourselves, we bear the political weight of the decision without even the credit of having caused it. ?]
[? if spd_pk_vote = "no": Only the dissident wing of the SPD and the KPD voted against; the rest of the chamber carried the measure easily. ?]
[? if spd_pk_vote = "abstain": Our abstention changed nothing — the other parties carried the vote without us. ?]

@panzerkreuzer_fail
on-arrival: nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent); panzerkreuzer_failed = 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent)

The votes are tallied in the Reichstag.

**For** ([+ panzerkreuzer_a_yes +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_a_yes_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_a_yes_list +]
**Against** ([+ panzerkreuzer_a_no +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_a_no_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_a_no_list +]
**Abstaining** ([+ panzerkreuzer_a_abstain +] seats): [+ panzerkreuzer_a_abstain_list +]

Against expectations, the coalition's numbers fall short. The battlecruiser proposal fails in the Reichstag. The ship will not be built.
